-- the PC habit: configure and probe at once --
after writing div=26, reading id:  gate=0x00000000 held=0xffffffff  UART id=0x00000000 div=0
driver says: id 0x00000000 is not 0x00011550, "no device"

-- the SoC way: dependencies first, in the order the plan says --
clock 5 on (reset still held):     gate=0x00000020 held=0xffffffff  UART id=0x00000000 div=0
reset 5 released:                  gate=0x00000020 held=0xffffffdf  UART id=0x00011550 div=0
the earlier write of div=26 was lost: div reads 0
div=26 written again:              gate=0x00000020 held=0xffffffdf  UART id=0x00011550 div=26
probe ok
